We inform you that the Company has published the Public Notice under Regulation 6(1)(c) of the SEBI (Delisting of Equity Shares) Regulations, 2021 please find enclosed herewith newspaper clippings of notice for proposed voluntary delisting of Company's Equity Shares from Metropolitan Stock Exchange of India Limited (MSEI) and Calcutta Stock Exchange Limited ('CSE') published in following newspapers :
1. 'Financial Express' (English national daily);
2. 'Jansatta' (Hindi national daily);
3. 'Pratahkal' (Marathi regional language) ;
4. 'Arthik Lipi' (Bengali regional language).

Nivaka Fashions Ltdhas informed BSE that the meeting of the Board of Directors of the Company is scheduled on 14/11/2026 ,inter alia, to consider and approve 1.To consider and approve unaudited financial results for the quarter and half year ended September 30, 2026, along with the Limited Review Report of the Statutory Auditor of the company;
2.To consider and approve the voluntary delisting of the equity shares of the Company from Metropolitan Stock Exchange of India Limited (MSEI) and The Calcutta Stock Exchange Limited (CSE) without giving any exit opportunity to its shareholders in accordance with the Regulations 5 & 6 of Securities and Exchange Board of India (Delisting of Equity Shares) Regulations, 2021;
3.Any other business with the permission of the Chairperson
